From 9e22d04cd1759aa948f96984cf19b1bccded1d76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:15:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0241: fix the ExpHeap lookup in the 0240 trampoline (use
 getCurrentHeap)

0240 read [x25] as a vtable, but [x25] is struct S's first field = DATA,
so it jumped to a .data address (DmIOS-2026-11-24-154754.ips:
EXC_BAD_ACCESS at 0x11019a0e8, CODESIGNING Invalid Page, frame 1 =
0x97e278). Get the current heap via sead::getCurrentHeap (0x9564a0) --
the same function the dispatcher 0x93eb50 calls when the allocator arg
is NULL -- then call that heap's vtable+0x30 allocate. Guard against
the current heap being the FrameHeap (would recurse); fall back to V.
The 0240 concept (overflow -> ExpHeap) is unchanged.
---
 dm/games/0100000000010000/patches.py | 133 ++++++++++++++++++---------
 dm/tools/nso_asm.py                  |   3 +
 2 files changed, 92 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

